1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:09,603
Speaking, task three. Story number 8: A working day. What did Ivan do yesterday? Tell the story from the pictures in the past tense.

2
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:11,858
What did Ivan do yesterday?

3
00:00:32,567 --> 00:00:34,757
Yesterday Ivan got up at four in the morning.

4
00:00:34,967 --> 00:00:38,126
He got dressed quickly, drank a coffee and went to work.

5
00:00:38,333 --> 00:00:40,097
He works in a big warehouse.

6
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:43,200
All morning he loaded heavy boxes into a lorry.

7
00:00:43,400 --> 00:00:45,667
The work was hard but it went well.

8
00:00:45,867 --> 00:00:48,167
At noon he had lunch with colleagues in the canteen.

9
00:00:48,367 --> 00:00:50,095
He had soup and goulash.

10
00:00:50,300 --> 00:00:51,862
They talked about football.

11
00:00:52,067 --> 00:00:53,951
In the evening Ivan was very tired.

12
00:00:54,167 --> 00:00:56,933
He rested at home on the sofa and watched TV.

13
00:00:57,133 --> 00:01:06,212
Tell story 8 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
